Hi everyone,

Week 3 (Tue 3 Nov to Mon 9 Nov, US dates) is decided, and Drake Powell Fan Club did not lose it. no worries city finished last.

| Team | Wed 4 | Thu 5 | Fri 6 | Sat 7 | Sun 8 | Mon 9 | Week 3 total |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| no worries city | 389 | 51 | 390 | 300 | 433 | 247 | 1810 |
| Drake Powell Fan Club | 483 | 100 | 365 | 259 | 310 | 299 | 1816 |
| Champions | 398 | 21 | 455 | 227 | 332 | 424 | 1857 |
| Eggy's doom squad | 556 | 162 | 218 | 482 | 274 | 404 | 2096 |
| Hang Low, Shoot High | 554 | 152 | 439 | 441 | 354 | 514 | 2454 |
| 5 Guys "Don't drop the soap" | 664 | 296 | 404 | 445 | 215 | 636 | 2660 |

no worries city finished on 1,810. Drake Powell Fan Club finished on 1,816, six points ahead. There was no NBA game on Tuesday 3 Nov, so the week had six scoring days.

How we know the numbers are right: each day's points are what ESPN shows each team's starters scoring that day, and the days add up to ESPN's own season totals for every team, exactly:

| Team | ESPN season total | Sum of our days | Match |
|---|---|---|---|
| Drake Powell Fan Club | 6590 | 6590 | yes |
| Hang Low, Shoot High | 6663 | 6663 | yes |
| no worries city | 5900 | 5900 | yes |
| 5 Guys "Don't drop the soap" | 7473 | 7473 | yes |
| Eggy's doom squad | 6274 | 6274 | yes |
| Champions | 6584 | 6584 | yes |

That makes no worries city last in weeks 1, 2 and 3 (1,987 / 2,103 / 1,810), so the punishment count for that team stands.

If anyone has a different total from ESPN for any day, send the screenshot and we will recheck. The margin is small, so a late stat correction could move it.

